    {
      "id": "concept-gift-of-the-magi-parody",
      "kind": "concept",
      "promptEs": "El regalo de los Reyes Magos y su parodia",
      "questionEn": "What literary joke is suggested by El robo de los Reyes Magos?",
      "answerEn": "O. Henry's story has each partner secretly sell their own prized possession to buy a gift for the other. The parody changes the gift into theft: each person sells the other's property, and each purchase serves the seller's own plans.",
      "noteEn": "The English title Theft of the Magi plays on O. Henry's The Gift of the Magi. The Spanish title makes the same contrast between regalo, “gift,” and robo, “theft.”",
      "tags": ["concept", "literature", "O. Henry", "The Gift of the Magi", "parody"]
    }
  ],
